      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 112:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed are those who fear the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.112.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.112.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 112:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who find great delight in his commands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 112:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their children will be mighty in the land;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 112:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the generation of the upright will be blessed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 112:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wealth and riches are in their houses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 112:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and their righteousness endures forever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 112:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even in darkness light dawns for the upright,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 112:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for those who are gracious and compassionate and righteous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 112:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Good will come to those who are generous and lend freely,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 112:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who conduct their affairs with justice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.112.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.112.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
